/H011701/2019/W29.png\" />所示，其中U为路端电压，I为干路电流，则测得的电源电动势E=____ V， 电源内电阻r=____ Ω。（保留2位有效数字）", "topicType": "主观题", "ueId": 467457, "umcId": 14407089, "userKey": "", "userKeyImg1": "", "userKeyImg2": "", "userKeyImg3": "", "userScore": 0, "wcId": 19}, {"a": "", "accuracyAmount": 0, "analyze": "4mol\n本题考查了物质的量浓度计算的知识点。每摩尔Na<sub>2</sub>S电离出2molNa<sup>+</sup>，所以Na<sup>+</sup>的物质的量浓度为2x0.2mol/L = 0.4mol/L，由n= cv知n=0.4mol/Lx10L = 4mol。\n", "b": "", "c": "", "catId": 0, "correct": false, "correctTimesAmount": 0, "d": "", "diffCoeff": 0, "e": "", "econtent": "", "exerId": 467458, "exerType": "历年真题", "f": "", "freqCoeff": 0, "g": "", "h": "", "htmlTag": true, "jcontent": "", "keyType": "填空题", "matRef": "", "myCollectionId": 0, "newKeyType": 3, "optNum": 1, "pptId": 0, "prName": "2018年成考高升本物理化学真题", "pracTimesAmount": 12, "questionType": 3, "reviewExerGroupRecId": 0, "rightKey": "", "rightRate": 0, "score": 5, "scoreLess": 0, "scoreRules": 0, "scoringMethod": 1, "simExamScore": 5, "source": "2018年", "starCount": 0, "title": "在10L0.2mol/LNa2S溶液中，钠离子的物质的量为____。", "topicType": "主观题", "ueId": 467458, "umcId": 14407089, "userKey": "", "userKeyImg1": "", "userKeyImg2": "", "userKeyImg3": "", "userScore": 0, "wcId": 20}, {"a": "", "accuracyAmount": 0, "analyze": "Fe<sup>2+</sup>， A1<sup>3+</sup>  Alo<sup>2-</sup>\n本题考查了金属活动性顺序表及金属氧化性强弱顺序的知识点。由于金属活动性强弱关系：Al&gt;Fe&gt;Cu，氧化性：Fe<sup>2+</sup>&gt;&gt;Cu<sup>2+</sup>&gt;Fe<sup>2+</sup>，所以过量的铁粉和Fe<sup>2+</sup>发生归中反应生成Fe，之后与Cu反应生成Fe<sup>2+</sup>，而不能置换出铝，所以过滤后滤液中存在的金属阳离子是Fe2 +和没反应的A1<sup>3+</sup>。过量的NaOH与A1<sup>3+</sup>反应生成Alo<sup>2-</sup>，以及存在的CI<sup>-</sup>和过量的0H<sup>-</sup>。\n", "b": "", "c": "", "catId": 0, "correct": false, "correctTimesAmount": 0, "d": "", "diffCoeff": 0, "e": "", "econtent": "", "exerId": 467459, "exerType": "历年真题", "f": "", "freqCoeff": 0, "g": "", "h": "", "htmlTag": true, "jcontent": "", "keyType": "填空题", "matRef": "", "myCollectionId": 0, "newKeyType": 3, "optNum": 1, "pptId": 0, "prName": "2018年成考高升本物理化学真题", "pracTimes