, "jcontent": "", "keyType": "填空题", "matRef": "", "myCollectionId": 0, "newKeyType": 3, "optNum": 1, "pptId": 0, "prName": "2018年成考高升本物理化学真题", "pracTimesAmount": 12, "questionType": 3, "reviewExerGroupRecId": 0, "rightKey": "", "rightRate": 0, "score": 5, "scoreLess": 0, "scoreRules": 0, "scoringMethod": 1, "simExamScore": 5, "source": "2018年", "starCount": 0, "title": "水垢中常含有碱式碳酸镁，化学式为Mg<sub>2</sub>（OH）<sub>2</sub>CO<sub>3</sub>，其与稀盐酸反应的离子方程式内为____。", "topicType": "主观题", "ueId": 467461, "umcId": 14407089, "userKey": "", "userKeyImg1": "", "userKeyImg2": "", "userKeyImg3": "", "userScore": 0, "wcId": 23}, {"a": "", "accuracyAmount": 0, "analyze": "红色\n本题考查了水解的知识以及指示剂的运用的知识点。碳酸根离子水解，水分离成氢离子和氢氧根离子，氢离子和碳酸根反应，消耗了溶液中的氢离子，从而整体显弱碱性，酚酞遇碱变红，故溶液显红色。\n", "b": "", "c": "", "catId": 0, "correct": false, "correctTimesAmount": 1, "d": "", "diffCoeff": 0, "e": "", "econtent": "", "exerId": 467462, "exerType": "历年真题", "f": "", "freqCoeff": 0, "g": "", "h": "", "htmlTag": false, "jcontent": "", "keyType": "填空题", "matRef": "", "myCollectionId": 0, "newKeyType": 3, "optNum": 1, "pptId": 0, "prName": "2018年成考高升本物理化学真题", "pracTimesAmount": 12, "questionType": 3, "reviewExerGroupRecId": 0, "rightKey": "", "rightRate": 0, "score": 5, "scoreLess": 0, "scoreRules": 0, "scoringMethod": 1, "simExamScore": 5, "source": "2018年", "starCount": 0, "title": "向碳酸钾水溶液加入酚酞指示剂，溶液显___色 。", "topicType": "主观题", "ueId": 467462, "umcId": 14407089, "userKey": "", "userKeyImg1": "", "userKeyImg2": "", "userKeyImg3": "", "userScore": 0, "wcId": 24}, {"a": "", "accuracyAmount": 0, "analyze": "分液漏斗,CO<sub>2</sub>\n本题考查了气体的制法的知识点。锌粒和醋酸：因为乙酸是弱酸，所以与锌反应时开始出现少量气泡，反应较平缓持久，而反应生成的气体为H<sub>2</sub>，应用向下排空气法收集氢气，图中为向上排空气法。二氧化锰和浓盐酸需要在加热的条件下进行。铜粉和稀硝酸反应生成的NO密度和空气非常接近，难溶于水，只能用排水法收集。\n", "b": "", "c": "", "catId": 0, "correct": false, "correctTimesAmount": 0, "d": "", "diffCoeff": 0, "e": "", "econtent": "", "exerId": 467463, "exerType": "历年真题", "f": "", "freqCoeff": 0, "g": "", "h": "", "htmlTag": true, "jcontent": "", "keyType": "填空题", "matRef": "", "myCollectionId": 0, "newKeyType": 3, "optNum": 1, "pptId": 0, "prName": "2018年成考高升本物理化学真题", "pracTimesAmount": 12, "questionType": 3, "reviewExerGroupRecId": 0, "rightKey": "", "rightRate": 0, "score": 5, "scoreLess": 0, "scoreRules": 0, "scoringMethod": 1, "simExamScore": 5, "source": "2018年", "starCount": 0, "title": "下图是一套发生、干燥和收集气体的装置，其中仪器A的名称为____，利用这套装置，选取合适的一组物质（锌粒和醋酸、碳酸钠和稀硫酸、二氧化锰和浓盐酸、铜粉和稀硝酸），可以制取的气体的化学式为____。<img src=\"http://ppt.beegoedu.com/CourseIMG/H011701/2019/W31.png\" />", "topicType": "主观题", "ueId": 467463, "umcId": 14407089, "userKey": "", "userKeyImg1": "", "userKeyImg2": "", "userKeyImg3": "", "userScore": 0, "wcId": 25}, {"a": "", "accuracyAmount": 0, "analyze": "<img src=\"http://ppt.beegoedu.com/CourseIMG/H011701/2019/W32.png\" />\n本题考查了物质的性质和元素周期律的综合运用的知识点。由题知常温常压下Z的单质为黄绿色气体，则乙为CI，其原子结构示意图为<img src=\"http://ppt.beegoedu.com/CourseIMG/H011701/2019/W33.png\" />；因为X、Y为烃类化合物的组成元素，且X、Y的原子序数依次增大，故X为H元素，Y为C元素，C、H组成的最简单的烃类为CH，其电子式为<img src=\"http://ppt.beegoedu.com/CourseIMG/H011701/2019/W34.png\" />。\n", "b": "", "c": "", "catId": 0, "correct": false, "correctTimesAmount": 0, "d": "", "diffCoeff": 0, "e": "", "econtent": "", "exerId": 467464, "exerType": "历年真题", "f": "", "freqCoeff": 0, "g": "", "h": "", "htmlTag": true, "jcontent": "", "keyType": "填空题", "matRef": "", "myCollectionId": 0, "newKeyType": 3, "optNum": 1, "pptId": 0, "prName": "2018年成考高升本物理化学真题", "pracTimesAmount": 12, "questionType": 3, "reviewExerGroupRecId": 0, "rightKey": "", "rightRate": 0, "score": 5, "scoreLess": 0, "scoreRules": 0, "scoringMethod": 1, "simExamScore": 5, "source": "2018年", "starCount": 0, "title": "X、Y、Z三种短周期元素的原子序数依次增大，X、Y为烃类化合物的组成元素常温常压下Z的单质为黄绿色气体。请回答：（1）Z元素的原子结构示意图为___；（2）X、Y组成的最简单烃的电子式为___。", "topicType": "主观题", "ueId": 467464, "umcId": 14407089, "userKey": "", "userKeyImg1": "", "userKeyImg2": "", "userKeyImg3": "", "userScore": 0, "wcId": 26}, {"a": "", "accuracyAmount": 0, "analyze": "本题考查了功能关系、圆周运动中向心力计算的知识点。由动能定理可得：mgh=1/2mv<sub>B</sub><sup>2</sup>①\nh= R- Rcos60°②\n联立①②式得<img src=\"http://ppt.beegoedu.com/CourseIMG/H011701/2019/W36.png\" />。\n", "b": "", "c": "", "catId": 0, "correct": false, "correctTimesAmount": 0, "d": "", "diffCoeff": 0, "e": "", "econtent": "", "exerId": 467465, "exerType": "历年真题", "f": "", "freqCoeff": 0, "g": "", "h": "", "htmlTag": true, "jcontent": "", "keyType": "计算题", "matRef": "", "myCollectionId": 0, "newKeyType": 3, "optNum": 1, "pptId": 0, "prName": "2018年成考高升本物理化学真题", "pracTimesAmount": 12, "questionType": 3, "reviewExerGroupRecId": 0, "rightKey": "", "rightRate": 0, "score": 9, "scoreLess": 0, "scoreRules": 0, "scoringMethod": 1, "simExamScore": 9, "source": "2018年", "starCount": 0, "title": "如图<img src=\"http://ppt.beegoedu.com/CourseIMG/H011701/2019/W35.png\" />，一质量为m的物块，从静止开始沿半\n圆形光滑轨道从A点滑到B点。已知0点为圆心OA与竖直方向OB的夹角为60°，圆轨道半径为R。重力加速度为g，忽略空气阻力。求\n物块经过B点时速度的大小。", "topicType": "主观题", "ueId": 467465, "umcId": 14407089, "userKey": "", "userKeyImg1": "", "userKeyImg2": "", "userKeyImg3": "", "userScore": 0, "wcId": 27}, {"a": "", "accuracyAmount": 0, "analyze": "本题考查了功能关系、圆周运动中向心力计算的知识点。物块做圆周运动所需向心力由轨道对物块的支持力提供<img src=\"http://ppt.beegoedu.com/CourseIMG/H011701/2019/W37.png\" />\n联立③④式得<img src=\"http://ppt.beegoedu.com/CourseIMG/H011701/2019/W38.png\" />\n", "b": "", "c": "", "catId": 0, "correct": false, "correctTimesAmount": 0, "d": "", "diffCoeff": 0, "e": "", "econtent": "", "exerId": 467466, "exerType": "历年真题", "f": "", "freqCoeff": 0, "g": "", "h": "", "htmlTag": true, "jcontent": "", "keyType": "计算题", "matRef": "", "myCollectionId": 0, "newKeyType": 3, "optNum": 1, "pptId": 0, "prName": "2018年成考高升本物理化学真题", "pracTimesAmount": 12, "questionType": 3, "reviewExerGroupRecId": 0, "rightKey": "", "rightRate": 0, "score": 9, "scoreLess": 0, "scoreRules": 0, "scoringMethod": 1, "simExamScore": 9, "source": "2018年", "starCount": 0, "title": "如图<img src=\"http://ppt.beegoedu.com/CourseIMG/H011701/2019/W35.png\" />，一质量为m的物块，从静止开始沿半\n圆形光滑轨道从A点滑到B点。已知0点为圆心OA与竖直方向OB的夹角为60°，圆轨道半径为R。重力加速度为g，忽略空气阻力。求\n物块经过B点时，轨道对物块的支持力的大小。", "topicType": "主观题", "ueId": 467466, "umcId": 14407089, "userKey": "", "userKeyImg1": "", "userKeyImg2": "", "userKeyImg3": "", "userScore": 0, "wcId": 28}, {"a": "", "accuracyAmount": 0, "analyze": "解：当MN匀速运动时，由平衡条件可得F = umg+BIL①\n感应电流<img src=\"http://ppt.beegoedu.com/CourseIMG/H011701/2019/W40.png\" />\n动生电动势E=BLv③\n联立①②③式得<img src=\"http://ppt.beegoedu.com/CourseIMG/H011701/2019/W41.png\" />\n", "b": "", "c": "", "catId": 0, "correct": false, "correctTimesAmount": 0, "d": "", "diffCoeff": 0, "e": "", "econtent": "", "exerId": 467467, "exerType": "历年真题", "f": "", "freqCoeff": 0, "g": "", "h": "", "htmlTag": true, "jcontent": "", "keyType": "计算题", "matRef": "", "myCollectionId": 0, "newKeyType": 3, "optNum": 1, "pptId": 0, "prName": "2018年成考高升本物理化学真题", "pracTimesAmount": 12, "questionType": 3, "reviewExerGroupRecId": 0, "rightKey": "", "rightRate": 0, "score": 9, "scoreLess": 0, "scoreRules": 0, "scoringMethod": 1, "simExamScore": 9, "source": "2018年", "starCount": 0, "title": "如图<img src=\"http://ppt.beegoedu.com/CourseIMG/H011701/2019/W39.png\" />，宽度为L的金属框架abcd固定于水平面内，框架电阻可不计。一质量为的金属棒MN放置在框架上，金属棒在两导轨之间的电阻为R，与框架的动摩擦因数为μ。现沿垂直于框架平面加一匀强磁场，磁感应强度大小为B，方向垂直于纸面向里。当以恒力F水平向右拉金属捧MN时，金属棒最后匀速运动。已知金属棒运动过程中与bc边平行，且与导轨接触良好，重力加速度为g。求金属棒匀速运动时速度的大小。", "topicType": "主观题", "ueId": 467467, "umcId": 14407089, "userKey": "", "userKeyImg1": "", "userKeyImg2": "", "userKeyImg3": "", "userScore": 0, "wcId": 29}, {"a": "", "accuracyAmount": 0, "analyze": "本题考查了不纯净物质的计算的知识点。根据题意可知Cr<sub>2</sub>O<sub>72</sub> <sup>-</sup>与Fe<sup>2+</sup>反应生成Cr<sup>3+</sup>和Fe<sup>3+</sup>，由氧化还原反应中得失电子守恒可知反应为Cr<sub>2</sub>O<sub>72</sub> <sup>-</sup>+6Fe<sup>2+</sup>\n+ 14H<sup>+</sup>=6Fe<sup>3+</sup> + 2Cr<sup>3+</sup>+ 7H<sub>2</sub>O。1000m<sup>3</sup>的废水中Cr<sub>2</sub>O<sub>72</sub> <sup>-</sup>的物质的量为4.9x10<sup>-4</sup>moI/Lx1000x103L = 490mol。由方程式可知需Fe<sup>2+</sup>的物质的量为2940mol，则需要98%的绿矾的质量为<img src=\"http://ppt.beegoedu.com/CourseIMG/H011701/2019/W42.pn